  BookText: "There have been several reports of travelers going missing after nightfall
    in the abandoned mines entrance west from our City.\n\nMost believe it\u2019s
    nothing, but a few locals claim to have seen pale figures near the old abandoned
    mines entrance.\n\nAnyone capable of handling the matter should investigate the
    area, locate their hiding place, and deal with this threat.\n\nThe entrance will
    probably be inaccesible during the day, so anyone that wants to investigate should
    do so at night time.\n\nThe roads need to be safe again.\n\n- Count Thevenin
    Thibault"
  CantBeTaken: 0
  isNoteOrScroll: 1
